  Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1; each license file
  above carries the copyright line of its font. They are the unmodified files
  from https://github.com/google/fonts (only renamed), and they are the fonts
  of the three styles (Cisza, Precyzja, Ciepło). See docs/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
for the rest of the components that ship inside the app.

They are bundled rather than taken from the system so that the app renders the
same on every platform, and so that widget tests have a font to draw with.
